          "headline": "Modi speaks to Zelenskyy, Jaishankar to Lavrov, as Ukraine peace talks begin",
          "summary": "PM Narendra Modi spoke by phone with Ukraine's Volodymyr Zelenskyy on Monday and repeated that the war should end through dialogue and diplomacy, saying India is ready to help. The same evening, External Affairs Minister S Jaishankar discussed the Ukraine peace efforts and India-Russia ties with Russia's Sergey Lavrov.",
