          "headline": "US, Russia and Ukraine open two days of peace talks in Abu Dhabi",
          "summary": "Negotiators from the three countries meet in Abu Dhabi on Tuesday, their first three-way talks since February, with US envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner mediating. Security guarantees for Ukraine and a post-war security set-up are the main topics, and a US official says any territory deal would come last. Russia insists the talks stay three-way, while European officials are in Abu Dhabi holding separate meetings with Kyiv's team.",
